*.local
.DS_Store

# Secrets never belong here.
.env
.env.*.local

# Committed on purpose, as an exception to the line above: it holds one
# localhost URL and nothing secret, and without it a fresh clone's
# `npm run dev:landing` has an "Explore Bambai" button that 404s, because the
# map runs on a different port in development. Never put a secret in here.
!.env.development
